@startuml View Cart - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "CartController" as CartCtrl
participant "Cart" as Cart
participant "CartItem" as CartItem
participant "View" as View

== View Cart ==
Customer -> CartCtrl: index()
CartCtrl -> Cart: getActiveCart()
Cart --> CartCtrl: cart
CartCtrl -> CartItem: where(cart_id)->with(product)
CartItem --> CartCtrl: cart_items
CartCtrl -> Cart: getTotal()
Cart --> CartCtrl: total
CartCtrl -> View: show cart.index(cart, cart_items, total)
View --> Customer: display cart page

@enduml
